# Pilot policy: one agent, one resource, a fixed budget of tool calls (no time window).
#
# `load` counts the calls made so far and `delta` is the cost of one call. Capacity is 101,
# not 100: the conservative margin (D16) denies an exact fit, so 101 admits 100 calls.
# The Rust host must use the same numbers: PolicyBounds { max_capacity: 101.0, max_delta_per_call: 1.0 }.
dim load in [0, 101]
dim delta in [0, 1]
rule per_call_cap: delta <= 1
rule budget: load + delta <= 101
